<section class="solution-section">
  <div class="solution-content">
    <h2>Kalender Hijriah yang <span class="accent">Benar</span></h2>
    <p>
      MABIMS API menyajikan data kalender resmi yang digunakan oleh
      Kemenag Indonesia, Singapura, dan Malaysia. Di luar cakupan tabel,
      tanggal tetap konsisten karena dihitung langsung dengan kriteria
      Neo MABIMS, bukan tebakan astronomi.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="solution-demo">
    <div class="demo-header">
      <span class="demo-label">Coba sekarang</span>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-block">
      <div class="demo-row">
        <span class="demo-method">GET</span>
        <code class="demo-url">/api/v1/today</code>
      </div>
      <pre class="demo-response">{`{
  "input": { "date": "2026-08-26", "tz": "Asia/Jakarta" },
  "output": { "date": "1448-03-11", "calendar": "hijri" },
  "source": "mabims",
  "warnings": []
}`}</pre>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-note">
      <code>source: "mabims"</code> — data dari tabel resmi Kemenag, bukan perhitungan
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .solution-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem) 0;
    align-items: center;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  @media (min-width: 64rem) {
    .solution-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  .solution-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .solution-content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1rem + 3vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .solution-content h2 .accent {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent);
  }

  .solution-content p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 0.5rem + 1vw, 1.125rem);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .solution-demo {
    background: #161b22;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .demo-header {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .demo-label {
    font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
    color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .demo-block {
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .demo-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .demo-method {
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.15);
    color: #22c55e;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: monospace;
  }

  .demo-url {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;
  }

  .demo-response {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1rem;
